    "title": "OTC Health Solutions",
    "description": "It's easy to access and manage your OTC Benefit from anywhere with the OTC Health Solutions app.  Get simple, secure access to your health and over-the-counter (OTC) benefits and use them at nearby CVS stores or online.\r\n\r\n- Take control of your benefits with real-time balance updates on funds and activity\r\n\r\n- View transaction history for benefits used and track order status\r\n\r\n- Easily find CVS stores where you can use your benefits in store, or order online\r\n\r\n- Shop on your own terms with convenient CVS in-store, online, and home delivery options",
